  "releaseNotes": "Fixes case-sensitive matching of AdditionalSensitiveHeaders: custom sensitive header names are now redacted regardless of the casing the client sends, matching the documented case-insensitive behavior of the built-in headers. Previously a configured header was only redacted when its casing matched the incoming request header exactly, which could leak secret header values into logs.",
